# Harith, Time Traveler

> Harith is a hybrid dash-loop mage played in the Gold Lane, not a burst mage. He does not one-shot, he does not rotate cleanly for ganks, and he does almost nothing useful for the first six minutes. What he does do is turn a single skill cast into a two-minute cooldown cycle that an unprepared draft cannot peel off a backline.

