## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Dash Loop Default (Gold)

- Items: Magic Boots, Starlium Scythe, Feather of Heaven, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Starlium Scythe, Feather of Heaven, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Concentrated Energy over Blood Wings when Use when fights last long enough for repeated Magic Damage to stack Recharge before the backline resets.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one hard engage can kill you before Zaman Force gives enough dash space.; Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use against low-Magic-Defense lanes when early kill pressure matters more than reaching the cooldown loop faster.; Wishing Lantern over Blood Wings when Use only when HP-stacking frontliners are the real targets and your team already protects your entry.
- Total cost: 12030 gold

Default gold lane setup that reaches the Starlium plus Feather dash loop, then turns Holy Crystal and Divine Glaive into real carry damage.

### Gold Anti-CC Sustain (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Starlium Scythe, Feather of Heaven, Holy Crystal, Concentrated Energy, Divine Glaive
- Core: Starlium Scythe, Feather of Heaven, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Blood Wings over Concentrated Energy when Use when the fight is decided by shield movement and burst spacing rather than extended Recharge stacks.; Winter Crown over Concentrated Energy when Use when Saber, Kaja, or a similar pick tool can force your Purify before the real burst lands.; Oracle over Concentrated Energy when Use in very late games when shield value and mixed durability matter more than another damage slot.; Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has damage but not enough crowd control to justify Fortitude.
- Total cost: 11940 gold

Safer gold lane setup for CC-heavy drafts where Harith must survive the first lockout before chaining Chrono Dash shields.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Starlium Scythe, Feather of Heaven, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Winter Crown
- Core: Starlium Scythe, Feather of Heaven, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when your lanes can cover your entry and you need movement plus shield tempo for repeated chases.; Concentrated Energy over Winter Crown when Use when objective fights are slow and you can keep landing enhanced basics without being burst first.; Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the first two ganks need flat Magic Penetration more than maximum cooldown cycling.; Immortality over Winter Crown when Use for the last objective setup when revive value is stronger than a stasis active.
- Total cost: 11840 gold

Jungle setup for protected drafts where Harith can farm Starlium Scythe quickly, contest with Ice Retribution, and chase inside Zaman Force.

